<title>HONG KONG: Salomon names Morse CEO for Asia-Pacific.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Morse CEO for Asia-Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said on Monday that Robert Morse, a managing director of the company and head of its global natural resources group, had been made chief executive officer of Salomon Brothers Asia-Pacific.</p>
<p>Morse joined the company in 1985.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers also said Michael Sargent, a managing director of the firm, has been appointed director of its Asia-Pacific Equity Research.</p>
<p>Sargent has served as the company's speciality chemcial analyst in U.S. equity research for the past five year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
